# Dollmaker's Shop: "Whenever one or more non-Toy creatures you control attack a player, create a 1/1 white Toy artifact
# creature token" (CR 508.1, 603.2c). In turn 3 Bot1 attacks Bot2 with Memnite and Ornithopter: one trigger, one Toy. In
# turn 4 Bot2's Memnite attacks Bot1: not Bot1's creature, no Toy. In turn 5 Bot1 attacks with the Toy alone: a Toy is no
# "non-Toy creature", no trigger. The token is a 1/1 white Toy artifact creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Dollmaker's Shop // Porcelain Gallery
Ornithopter
Memnite
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
