Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dollmaker's Shop // Porcelain Gallery.Cast(Ability: Dollmaker's Shop)
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Toy Token.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
